Wolf Meat Drop
    Events
        Unit - A unit Dies
    Conditions
        (Owner of (Killing unit)) Not equal to Neutral Hostile
        Or - Any (Conditions) are true
            Conditions
                (Unit-type of (Dying unit)) Equal to Timber Wolf (Level 2)
                (Unit-type of (Dying unit)) Equal to Giant Wolf (Level 4)
                (Unit-type of (Dying unit)) Equal to Dire Wolf (Level 5)
                (Unit-type of (Dying unit)) Equal to Wolf (Mount)
    Actions
        If (All Conditions are True) then do (Then Actions) else do (Else Actions)
            If - Conditions
                (Random integer number between 1 and 10) Equal to 1
            Then - Actions
                Set VariableSet DyingUnitPos = (Position of (Dying unit))
                Item - Create Raw Wolf Meat at DyingUnitPos
                Custom script:   call RemoveLocation(udg_DyingUnitPos)
            Else - Actions
